{#
  Shared "book a meeting" button. One markup source for every place this
  button appears (hero, last action section, footer, case study pages),
  per Christopher's direct request. Always opens Calendly's real popup
  scheduler; never links to an anchor. Pass riskReversal=true for the
  case study pages' third disclaimer line. Pass showPhone=false to omit
  the "or call/text" line, used once (the homepage's final booking
  section) on direct request, since the number already appears earlier
  on that same page. The "or email me directly" mailto line, added on a
  September 2026 build instruction, always shows regardless of
  showPhone: unlike the phone number, the email address isn't shown
  anywhere earlier on the homepage by the time you reach that section.
  Button text is "Book a free strategy call," changed from "Book my
  meeting with you." on direct request (build instruction from a
  September 2026 coaching session).
#}
{% macro button(wrapClass="actions", riskReversal=false, showPhone=true) %}
<div class="{{ wrapClass }}">
  <a class="cta" href="https://calendly.com/aweb3dad/15-minute-greeting" onclick="Calendly.initPopupWidget({url:'https://calendly.com/aweb3dad/15-minute-greeting'});return false;">
    <span>Book a free strategy call</span>
  </a>
  {% if showPhone %}<p class="call-alt">or call/text <a href="tel:+13107036003">(310) 703-6003</a></p>{% endif %}
  <p class="call-alt">or <a href="mailto:christopher@theweb3family.com?subject=Booking%20a%20call">email me directly</a></p>
  {% if riskReversal %}<p class="risk-reversal">Month to month. Everything built is yours.</p>{% endif %}
</div>
{% endmacro %}
